    52	    # ALL img_w column rotations — C512 at the registered img_w=512 — while the
    53	    # frame average symmetrises over the C4 subgroup alone. The rejection stands
    54	    # because their composition is a THIRD treatment neither experiment declared,
    55	    # not because the orbit already covers the augmentation.
