    90	    """Validate ``training.frame_avg_max_fwd_samples`` and return its wrapper kwargs.
    91	
    92	    exp_14's treatment (plan §3.1). The frame-average chunk plan — how many orbit
    93	    angles share one conditioner forward, and therefore one train-mode DINOv3
    94	    RoPE draw — used to be derived from a module constant
    95	    (``yaw_rotation.FRAME_AVG_MAX_FWD_SAMPLES``), which announcement 06 flags as
    96	    "derived, not declared": the same JSON at a different micro-batch, or a month
    97	    apart, trains a different method. Declaring it here puts it in the config that
    98	    ``train.py`` embeds into every checkpoint, so an arm's chunk plan is auditable
    99	    after the fact and comparable across arms.
