   101	    Absent key -> ``{}``, so the wrapper construction call is LITERALLY the
   102	    pre-change call and every recipe already in the record is byte-identical.
   103	
   104	    Every failure mode is fail-closed on the RAW value: a coerced ``int("32")`` or
   105	    a ``True`` that ``isinstance(_, int)`` happily accepts would arm the wrong
   106	    chunk plan for a six-day run without a word of complaint.
