  1051	# Unexpected-key prefixes a PL-wrapper checkpoint legitimately leaves after
  1052	# evaluate_model's 'diffusion.' strip: EMA copy/bookkeeping and loss-module buffers.
  1053	# Verified against outputs_FLAC/ft_vanilla/epoch=0-step=2000.ckpt (1279 keys):
  1054	# all 213 leftovers are diffusion_ema.* (212) + losses.* (1). Exported/bare
  1055	# checkpoints (FLAC_EMA.ckpt, *_ft.ckpt: 1066 keys) must load with zero of both.
