   703	    regroups the forwards — the numbers must be identical. This is what makes
   704	    ``--frame-avg-max-fwd-samples 64`` a protocol-identity pin rather than a
   705	    result-changing hyperparameter (plan §2 EVAL chunk plan)."""
   706	    md = _batch(64)
   707	    small, big = _build_cond(), _build_cond()
   708	    a = yr.fa_cartesian_conditioning(small, md, "cpu", C4, max_fwd_samples=64)
   709	    b = yr.fa_cartesian_conditioning(big, md, "cpu", C4, max_fwd_samples=256)
   710	    assert small.conditioners["source"].batch_sizes == [64, 64, 64, 64]
   711	    assert big.conditioners["source"].batch_sizes == [64, 192]   # all 3 angles at once
   712	    for key in POSE_KEYS:
   713	        assert torch.allclose(a[key][0], b[key][0], atol=1e-6)
