worklog/worklog_yixun/exp_21_bf_fa_cartesian_claude/bf_fa_cartesian_yixun_query.md:146:- The canonical-frame variant is the cheapest strong test: zero new learned parameters, embedder stays in-domain, invariance is exact on the panorama column group (and at 45° = exactly 64 columns of W=512), and it removes the 4× ViT orbit cost.
